flowchart TD
 A[Validate request, template, budgets] --> C1[Composer revision 1]
 C1 --> I1[Illustrator revision 1]
 I1 --> M1[Check and merge LaTeX]
 M1 --> S1[Solver: student view and merged source]
 S1 --> R1[Reviewer: exactly one review]
 R1 --> Q{Needs changes?}
 Q -->|No| H[Publish de_thi.tex and hand off to human]
 Q -->|Yes: one feedback| C2[Composer revision 2]
 C2 --> I2[Illustrator revision 2]
 I2 --> M2[Check and merge again]
 M2 --> S2[Solver revision 2]
 S2 --> H
